{"title":"My uncle Ken","link":"http://scripting.com/2025/08/07/130251.html?title=myUncleKen","date":1754571771000,"content":"<p>This is a picture of my dear departed <a href=\"http://scripting.com/2020/04/28/212326.html?title=uncleKenAndAuntDorothy\">Uncle Vava</a> taken in the early 1970s in my parents' house in Flushing. It just showed up in my On This Day list on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/dave.winer.12/posts/pfbid0Bx7wYu7ouX1NKksrgxCVFMRQigCwkaxqKDTqeCHRCcJ1i2SPkrXhbUTZFMvKS9Prl?notif_id=1754565616420103&amp;notif_t=feedback_reaction_generic&amp;ref=notif\">Facebook</a>, thought it belongs on the blog too. .</p>\n<p></p><div><img src=\"https://imgs.scripting.com/2025/08/07/uncleVava.png\" />Ken Kiesler, in the early 70s, hamming it up at a family event. </div><p></p>","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"4c79473b0199008b8a2e856bc9648768b23f7185f852dc6706412af17ba61433","category":"Sites"}